{{!
    @template tool_activitydates/modtable

    Table of a course's activities of one module type and the sessions they are
    scheduled into. One Dates column stacks each activity's open, (due), close
    and lock dates, each an input with a Hold checkbox. The inputs show the
    current values, or on Preview the proposals (held fields keep their
    values); inputs the user cannot change are disabled. The Grade-lock note
    column has the activity-page and course-page note checkboxes. The inputs sit
    outside the moodleform and carry form="formid" so they post with it.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * data-region="tool_activitydates-previewtable" with data-formid - the table wrapper
    * data-region="tool_activitydates-stale" - the stale-settings bar
    * data-cmid, data-field - on each date input and its hint
    * data-region="tool_activitydates-hint" - the inline hint after each date input
    * data-rowcontrol="cmid" - a checkbox enabled only while its row is selected
    * data-region="tool_activitydates-filter" - the name filter box
    * data-region="tool_activitydates-activityrow" with data-name - an activity's row
    * data-region="tool_activitydates-sessionrow" - a session header row
    * data-region="tool_activitydates-nomatch" - the row shown when the filter matches nothing

    Context variables required for this template:
    * formid string - the id of the moodleform the inputs submit with
    * fingerprint string - the settings fingerprint the table was built from
    * showlocks bool - whether to show the Grade-lock note column (:managelocks and a graded type)
    * fixhelp object - the core/help_icon context of the Hold help
    * modname string - the module type name (e.g. quiz), used in the activity links
    * showmarks bool - whether to show the Marks column
    * colcount int - number of visible columns, drives the session header colspan
    * hasrows bool - whether the table has rows, which shows the name filter
    * tabledata array - list of header and activity rows
      * isheader bool - true for a session header row
      * dates object - the session window (absent when the session is not scheduled)
        * sessionnumber int - the 1-based session number
        * startformatted string - session open date formatted for display
        * startattr string - session open date for the time element's datetime attribute
        * endformatted string - session close date formatted for display
        * endattr string - session close date for the time element's datetime attribute
      * id int - the course module id (activity rows)
      * name string - the activity name (activity rows)
      * intro string - the activity description (activity rows)
      * selected string - "checked" when the activity is selected (activity rows)
      * marks string - the formatted maximum grade (quiz activity rows)
      * editable bool - whether the row is selected and scheduled
      * statustext string - what Save does to a row that is not scheduled
      * fields array - the row's dates, in display order
        * field string - timeopen, duedate, timeclose or timelock
        * cmid int - the course module id
        * label string - the field's label
        * inputlabel string - the input's accessible name
        * value string - the input's value (YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM or empty)
        * disabled bool - whether the input is disabled
        * invalid bool - whether the value failed validation
        * error string - the value's error message
        * holdable bool - whether the field has a Hold checkbox (not Locked without a grade item)
        * fixed bool - whether the Hold checkbox is ticked
        * fixtoggle bool - whether the Hold checkbox follows the row's selection
        * fixdisabled bool - whether the Hold checkbox is disabled
        * fixlabel string - the Hold checkbox's accessible name
      * hasnotes bool - whether the row has note checkboxes (it has a grade item)
      * shownote bool - whether the activity-page note is ticked
      * shownotecoursepage bool - whether the course-page note is ticked
      * notedisabled bool - whether the note checkboxes are disabled (unselected rows)
      * hasnotedefault bool - whether the row's note checkboxes take the site defaults once it is selected
      * defaultnote bool - the site default of the activity-page note
      * defaultcoursenote bool - the site default of the course-page note

    Example context (json):
    {
        "formid": "tool_activitydates_dates_form",
        "fingerprint": "0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef01234567",
        "showlocks": true,
        "fixhelp": {
            "text": "Keep this date when the dates are previewed.",
            "alt": "Help with Hold",
            "ltr": true
        },
        "modname": "quiz",
        "showmarks": true,
        "colcount": 7,
        "hasrows": true,
        "tabledata": [
            {
                "isheader": true,
                "dates": {
                    "sessionnumber": 1,
                    "startformatted": "Fri 05 Jan 2024 10:00",
                    "startattr": "2024-01-05T10:00",
                    "endformatted": "Fri 12 Jan 2024 10:00",
                    "endattr": "2024-01-12T10:00"
                }
            },
            {
                "isheader": false,
                "id": 56,
                "name": "Quiz 1",
                "intro": "First quiz",
                "selected": "checked",
                "marks": "10.00",
                "editable": true,
                "statustext": "",
                "fields": [
                    {"field": "timeopen", "cmid": 56, "label": "Open", "inputlabel": "Open: Quiz 1",
                        "value": "2024-01-05T10:00", "disabled": false, "invalid": false, "error": "",
                        "holdable": true, "fixed": false, "fixtoggle": true, "fixdisabled": false, "fixlabel": "Hold Open for Quiz 1"},
                    {"field": "timeclose", "cmid": 56, "label": "Close", "inputlabel": "Close: Quiz 1",
                        "value": "2024-01-05T09:00", "disabled": false, "invalid": true,
                        "error": "The close date must be after the open date.",
                        "holdable": true, "fixed": true, "fixtoggle": true, "fixdisabled": false, "fixlabel": "Hold Close for Quiz 1"},
                    {"field": "timelock", "cmid": 56, "label": "Locked", "inputlabel": "Locked: Quiz 1",
                        "value": "", "disabled": true, "invalid": false, "error": "",
                        "holdable": true, "fixed": false, "fixtoggle": true, "fixdisabled": false, "fixlabel": "Hold Locked for Quiz 1"}
                ],
                "hasnotes": true,
                "shownote": true,
                "shownotecoursepage": false,
                "notedisabled": false,
                "hasnotedefault": false,
                "defaultnote": true,
                "defaultcoursenote": false
            },
            {
                "isheader": false,
                "id": 57,
                "name": "Quiz 2",
                "intro": "",
                "selected": "",
                "marks": "20.00",
                "editable": false,
                "statustext": "Not scheduled",
                "fields": [
                    {"field": "timeopen", "cmid": 57, "label": "Open", "inputlabel": "Open: Quiz 2",
                        "value": "", "disabled": true, "invalid": false, "error": "",
                        "holdable": true, "fixed": false, "fixtoggle": true, "fixdisabled": true, "fixlabel": "Hold Open for Quiz 2"}
                ],
                "hasnotes": true,
                "shownote": false,
                "shownotecoursepage": false,
                "notedisabled": true
            }
        ]
    }
}}
<div data-region="tool_activitydates-previewtable" data-formid="{{formid}}">
    <input type="hidden" name="tablefingerprint" form="{{formid}}" value="{{fingerprint}}">
    <div role="status">
        <div data-region="tool_activitydates-stale" class="alert alert-warning" hidden>{{#str}}tablestale, tool_activitydates{{/str}}</div>
    </div>
    {{#hasrows}}
    <div class="mb-2">
        <label class="form-label" for="tool_activitydates_filter">{{#str}}filterbyname, tool_activitydates{{/str}}</label>
        <input type="search" class="form-control w-auto" id="tool_activitydates_filter" data-region="tool_activitydates-filter"
            autocomplete="off" aria-controls="tool_activitydates_table">
    </div>
    {{/hasrows}}
    <div class="card">
        <div class="table-responsive">
            <table class="table table-hover table-bordered table-striped" id="tool_activitydates_table">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th scope="col">
                            <input type="checkbox" name="selectall" id="id_selectall"
                                aria-label="{{#str}}toggleselection, tool_activitydates{{/str}}"
                                title="{{#str}}toggleselection, tool_activitydates{{/str}}">
                        </th>
                        <th scope="col" class="col-md-0">{{#str}}name{{/str}}</th>
                        <th scope="col" class="col-md-3">{{#str}}description{{/str}}</th>
                        {{#showmarks}}
                            <th scope="col" class="col-md-1">{{#str}}marks, tool_activitydates{{/str}}</th>
                        {{/showmarks}}
                        <th scope="col">
                            {{#str}}datescolumn, tool_activitydates{{/str}}
                            {{#fixhelp}}{{>core/help_icon}}{{/fixhelp}}
                        </th>
                        {{#showlocks}}
                            <th scope="col">
                                <div>{{#str}}gradelocknoteheader, tool_activitydates{{/str}}</div>
                                <div class="form-check">
                                    <input type="checkbox" class="form-check-input" id="id_togglenotes"
                                        aria-label="{{#str}}togglenotes, tool_activitydates{{/str}}"
                                        title="{{#str}}togglenotes, tool_activitydates{{/str}}">
                                    <label class="form-check-label" for="id_togglenotes">{{#str}}noteactivitypage, tool_activitydates{{/str}}</label>
                                </div>
                                <div class="form-check">
                                    <input type="checkbox" class="form-check-input" id="id_togglecoursenotes"
                                        aria-label="{{#str}}togglecoursenotes, tool_activitydates{{/str}}"
                                        title="{{#str}}togglecoursenotes, tool_activitydates{{/str}}">
                                    <label class="form-check-label" for="id_togglecoursenotes">{{#str}}notecoursepage, tool_activitydates{{/str}}</label>
                                </div>
                            </th>
                        {{/showlocks}}
                        <th scope="col">{{#str}}status{{/str}}</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    {{^tabledata}}
                        <tr>
                            <td colspan="{{colcount}}">{{#str}}nomodulesincourse, tool_activitydates{{/str}}</td>
                        </tr>
                    {{/tabledata}}
                    {{#hasrows}}
                        <tr data-region="tool_activitydates-nomatch" hidden>
                            <td colspan="{{colcount}}">{{#str}}nofiltermatch, tool_activitydates{{/str}}</td>
                        </tr>
                    {{/hasrows}}
                    {{#tabledata}}
                        {{#isheader}}
                            <tr data-region="tool_activitydates-sessionrow">
                                <td colspan="{{colcount}}">
                                    {{#dates}}
                                        {{#str}}session, tool_activitydates{{/str}} {{sessionnumber}}:
                                        <time datetime="{{startattr}}">{{startformatted}}</time>
                                        &ndash;
                                        <time datetime="{{endattr}}">{{endformatted}}</time>
                                    {{/dates}}
                                    {{^dates}}
                                        {{#str}}session, tool_activitydates{{/str}} &mdash;
                                    {{/dates}}
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        {{/isheader}}
                        {{^isheader}}
                            <tr data-region="tool_activitydates-activityrow" data-name="{{name}}">
                                <td>
                                    <input type="checkbox" name="select" id="id_cmid_{{id}}"
                                        aria-label="{{name}}" {{selected}}>
                                </td>
                                <td><a href="{{config.wwwroot}}/mod/{{modname}}/view.php?id={{id}}">{{name}}</a></td>
                                <td>{{intro}}</td>
                                {{#showmarks}}
                                    <td>{{marks}}</td>
                                {{/showmarks}}
                                <td>
                                    {{#fields}}
                                        <div class="mb-1">
                                            <label class="form-label small text-muted mb-0" for="tool_activitydates_{{field}}_{{cmid}}">{{label}}</label>
                                            <div class="d-flex align-items-center">
                                                <input type="datetime-local" class="form-control{{#invalid}} is-invalid{{/invalid}}"{{#invalid}} aria-invalid="true"{{/invalid}}
                                                    name="{{field}}_rows[{{cmid}}]" form="{{formid}}" value="{{value}}"
                                                    data-cmid="{{cmid}}" data-field="{{field}}"
                                                    id="tool_activitydates_{{field}}_{{cmid}}"
                                                    aria-describedby="tool_activitydates_{{field}}_{{cmid}}_hint"
                                                    aria-label="{{inputlabel}}"{{#disabled}} disabled{{/disabled}}>
                                                {{#holdable}}
                                                <div class="form-check ms-2 text-nowrap">
                                                    <input type="checkbox" class="form-check-input" name="fix_{{field}}[{{cmid}}]" value="1"
                                                        form="{{formid}}" id="tool_activitydates_fix_{{field}}_{{cmid}}"
                                                        aria-label="{{fixlabel}}"{{#fixtoggle}} data-rowcontrol="{{cmid}}"{{/fixtoggle}}{{#fixed}} checked{{/fixed}}{{#fixdisabled}} disabled{{/fixdisabled}}>
                                                    <label class="form-check-label" for="tool_activitydates_fix_{{field}}_{{cmid}}">{{#str}}hold, tool_activitydates{{/str}}</label>
                                                </div>
                                                {{/holdable}}
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="invalid-feedback{{#invalid}} d-block{{/invalid}}" data-region="tool_activitydates-hint" data-cmid="{{cmid}}"
                                                data-field="{{field}}" id="tool_activitydates_{{field}}_{{cmid}}_hint">{{error}}</div>
                                        </div>
                                    {{/fields}}
                                </td>
                                {{#showlocks}}
                                    <td>
                                        {{#hasnotes}}
                                        <div class="form-check">
                                            <input type="checkbox" class="form-check-input" name="shownote_cmids[]" value="{{id}}" form="{{formid}}"
                                                id="id_shownote_{{id}}" data-rowcontrol="{{id}}"
                                                {{#hasnotedefault}}data-defaultchecked="{{#defaultnote}}1{{/defaultnote}}{{^defaultnote}}0{{/defaultnote}}"{{/hasnotedefault}}
                                                {{#shownote}}checked{{/shownote}}{{#notedisabled}} disabled{{/notedisabled}}>
                                            <label class="form-check-label" for="id_shownote_{{id}}">
                                                {{#str}}noteactivitypage, tool_activitydates{{/str}}
                                                <span class="visually-hidden">{{name}}</span>
                                            </label>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="form-check">
                                            <input type="checkbox" class="form-check-input" name="shownotecourse_cmids[]" value="{{id}}" form="{{formid}}"
                                                id="id_shownotecourse_{{id}}" data-rowcontrol="{{id}}"
                                                {{#hasnotedefault}}data-defaultchecked="{{#defaultcoursenote}}1{{/defaultcoursenote}}{{^defaultcoursenote}}0{{/defaultcoursenote}}"{{/hasnotedefault}}
                                                {{#shownotecoursepage}}checked{{/shownotecoursepage}}{{#notedisabled}} disabled{{/notedisabled}}>
                                            <label class="form-check-label" for="id_shownotecourse_{{id}}">
                                                {{#str}}notecoursepage, tool_activitydates{{/str}}
                                                <span class="visually-hidden">{{name}}</span>
                                            </label>
                                        </div>
                                        {{/hasnotes}}
                                    </td>
                                {{/showlocks}}
                                <td>{{statustext}}</td>
                            </tr>
                        {{/isheader}}
                    {{/tabledata}}
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
